AB  - This chapter explores the modern digital issues facing higher education including digital literacy and generative artificial intelligence. It argues that new technologies should not be avoided but incorporated into teaching and learning and institutions of higher education. It considers the role formative assessment can play in making digital skills integrated into curriculum. The chapter ends with a series of sample assignments demonstrating formative assessment and specifically formative assessment vis a vis the digital world. © 2024, IGI Global. All rights reserved.
