AB  - Autonomous learning is what college students need to learn. For some students who have difficulties in self-study, this paper develops a cloud computing intelligent optimization algorithm in the multimedia teaching mode of college students' English autonomous learning system. This platform can help self-learners learn translation, listening, speaking, and other skills. At the same time, the platform also includes a self-assessment system including diagnostic evaluation, formative evaluation, and summative evaluation. The final test shows that the recognition rate of the system can reach more than 95%, which can meet the needs of use.
