TI  - Human and Artificial Agent Interaction to Provide Generative Feedback at University
AU  - Giannandrea, Lorella
AU  - Gratani, Francesca
AU  - Laici, Chiara
AU  - Capolla, Lorenza Maria
AU  - Rossi, Pier Giuseppe
AU  - Scaradozzi, David
