AB  - Education is basically a system to achieve happiness and prosperity for all people. Quality education actually reflects a society that is advanced, peaceful, and produces constructive traits. For Indonesian students, this insight can be achieved when they have minimum competencies, namely Literacy, Numeracy, and Entrepreneurial Mindset skills which are then abbreviated as (LINE). This research focuses on building a Minimum Competency Mapping System website, then it is named “Assessment of Literacy, Numeracy and Entrepreneurial Mindset which is abbreviated as (LINE Assessment) Indonesian Students based on artificial intelligence”. The research method used is the Neuroresearch method which consists of three stages, namely exploratory research, explanatory research and confirmatory research. For website development using Agile Development Method. The result of the research is the design of the LINE Assessment website based on artificial intelligence.
