AB  - Krisna.ai is a web-based tool embedded in Sketchbook. This study describes the design, development, and evaluation of Krisna.ai. The system contains two main modules an Automatic Dialogue Function, based on a decision-tree approach to provide context-sensitive teaching replies, and an Automatic Questionnaire Function that allows structured reflection and formative assessment. Krisna.ai uses the DeepSeek API to enable interactive discussions between students and academics. It doesn’t compromise privacy since the AI is different from the one used by the faculty. Two experiments were done with 26 college students. The first evaluation studied the fluency, clarity and pedagogical worth of solution proposed by AI to open-ended academic questions. The second study evaluated engagement, understanding, and user choice between a chatbot-supported learning help and a static, manual question. Krisna.ai understands learner intention accurately, enhances user engagement, and allows learners to study in a systematic manner. Krisna.ai can help with the AI-empowered adaptive learning platform for education.
