AB  - Mathematics flipped classroom under ICT environment refers to a classroom form in which students experience meaningful “before-in-after-class” mathematics learning, complete a series of challenging mathematics learning tasks, and acquire mathematics deep learning ability based on teachers’ professional learning design and intelligent technology application. This study adopts rfcs/gn-based research methods, puts forward a mathematics flipped classroom teaching model under ICT environment based on deep learning and learning design theory and carries out mathematics flipped classroom teaching experiments in middle school. The results show that the model can improve students’ mathematics performance, and make students’ deep learning abilities develop.
