TI  - A formative evaluation of potential barriers and facilitators to inform effective implementation of a community-based hypertension care program in rural South  Africa: The IMPACT-BP trial.
AU  - Abrahams-Gessel, Shafika
AU  - Manyaapelo, Thabang
AU  - Sithole, Nsika
AU  - Dlamini, Siphephelo
AU  - Mpanza, Nondumiso
