AB  - Nowadays, Machine Learning (ML) is one of the most promising application areas in a field of Information Technology where its application scope is almost unlimited. The application of machine learning in an education area is currently very interesting to researchers and scientists, and it is the main focus of our study. The aim of this paper is to evaluate the possibilities of applying and using machine learning in the education area. This paper identifies and analyses suitable literature, research papers and articles in order to determine their categorization in the field of education, to determine the current trends of using machine learning in education, and to determine its current and future applications. © 2018, Danube Adria Association for Automation and Manufacturing, DAAAM. All rights reserved.
