AB  - As the title indicates, AI impacts the education system positively and negatively. In this research paper, we analyze students’ behavior based on different parameters and predict their learning adaptive capabilities toward AI tools. We can identify whether they are prone to AI tools or not. This is a general issue in our education system because we do not have an appropriate method to determine their behavior toward AI tools. This paper will describe how to create an adaptive environment for students to improvise their learning process which will play a significant role in making their careers remarkable. This research can act as a game changer in the education system. In this research paper, machine learning’s classification technique is used to analyze students’ behavior for adaptive learning and this will also elaborate on the level of student behavior toward the AI tools. This research paper delves into the infinite potential of our young generations. They are not meant only for traditional learning, they have multiple resources and ways to grow in their lives, so this research will help them to understand the key points and measure accordingly. This research paper utilizes data and algorithms these systems offer individualized learning pathways that cater to the distinct strengths and limitations of every learner while having the promises to implement the futuristic technological advancement in education. © The Author(s), under exclusive license to Springer Nature Singapore Pte Ltd. 2026.
