TI  - The Role of Generative Artificial Intelligence in Enhancing 4C Skills in Foreign Language Education: A Comprehensive Analysis
AU  - Orhan, A.
AU  - Yağcı, S.C.
AB  - This study explores how generative artificial intelligence (GenAI) supports the development of 21st-century skills-critical thinking, creativity, communication, and collaboration (4Cs)-in foreign language education through a systematic literature review. Findings indicate that GenAI enhances critical thinking by improving analytical reasoning and argumentation, supports creative writing, strengthens communication through real-time feedback, and fosters collaboration in interactive settings. However, issues such as ethical concerns, learner autonomy, and over-reliance on AI-generated content remain. The study emphasizes the need for balanced GenAI integration with human oversight and further research on its long-term impact on language learning and education, highlighting AI's transformative role and the importance of responsible use. © 2026, IGI Global Scientific Publishing. All rights reserved.
