AB  - This chapter explores the integration of SkyTutor, an AI-powered chatbot based on ChatGPT technology, into aviation English training for ab-initio pilots. Addressing the increasing global demand for skilled pilots, the chapter highlights the limitations of traditional training methods and the need for innovative solutions. SkyTutor was developed to bridge the gap between conventional instruction and modern technological capabilities, providing personalized, interactive learning experiences tailored to aviation communication protocols and theoretical knowledge. The chapter outlines SkyTutor's design, technical framework, and educational potential while critically analyzing its impact on both learners and instructors. By evaluating SkyTutor's strengths and shortcomings, this chapter contributes to understanding the transformative potential of AI tools in aviation education and their implications for enhancing communication skills, cognitive readiness, and instructional efficiency in the rapidly evolving aviation landscape. © 2026, IGI Global Scientific Publishing. All rights reserved.
