TI  - Development of Educational Resources Aimed at Learning Prepositions of Movement in the English Language Using Generative Artificial Intelligence and AI
AU  - Soberanes-Martín, A.
AU  - Castillo-Mendoza, J.L.
AU  - Serrano Pérez, E.
AB  - This chapter presents the development of educational resources to enrich the practice of prepositions of motion in English from a technological perspective. Web augmented reality technology is used to show animations that exemplify the use of prepositions in scenarios that combine virtual and objective elements. The representation of the situations has been carried out following recommendations obtained through generative artificial intelligence and the consultation of specialized literature on the subject of propositions in the English language. The educational resources developed can be used from any mobile device with Internet access and a camera, so it is possible to generate many scenarios and situations that encourage the practice of prepositions of motion. In this way, it is possible to address conditions that combine multiple elements, both real and virtual, favoring the teaching practice and the visual stimulation of the student by focusing on describing unique and dynamic scenarios that adapt to each user's particular interests anywhere and at any time. © 2026, IGI Global Scientific Publishing. All rights reserved.
