TI  - Innovating Curriculum Design with AI and Gamification: A Roadmap for Society 5.0
AU  - Mertayasa, I.
AU  - Saputra, P.W.
AB  - The digital revolution marked by the concept of Society 5.0 drives innovation in curriculum design through the integration of AI and gamification. This aims to create a more adaptive, interactive, and data-driven learning experience to enhance engagement and learning outcomes. AI is used to analyze learning data, provide real-time feedback, and adjust individual learning paths. Gamification applies game elements such as challenges, rewards, and leaderboards to motivate students. This integration offers extraordinary potential in enhancing educational effectiveness by tailoring the learning experience to individual needs. Its implementation requires attention to ethical aspects, algorithm transparency, and data privacy protection. this paper proposes a design framework for an AI-based gamification curriculum that considers personalized learning, data-driven feedback systems, and supporting technological infrastructure. With this approach, education can be more responsive to the challenges of the 21st century and equip students with relevant skills to face a technology-based future. © 2026 by IGI Global Scientific Publishing. All rights reserved.
