AB  - A solution that combines an open-source generic cloud-based AI-powered Knowledge Management (KM) Platform with custom-tailored curriculum content development to help integrate modern global AI knowledge and developments into the design of the Vocational Curriculum and Educational content delivery in India is introduced. It addresses how this AI-Powered KM Platform will interact with local AI employment trends, local environmental and non-technical challenges, and custom-tailored curriculum content. There is a rising demand for AI knowledge and education across economies globally as it outgrows its Computer Science roots into multidisciplinary and rapidly differentiating sectors like AI for social good, AI in healthcare, environmental preservation, innovation, energy, sustainability, and general global labor market transformations. © 2026, IGI Global Scientific Publishing. All rights reserved.
