AB  - In recent years, India has witnessed a transformative shift in educational methodologies, largely driven by the integration of chatbots and AI tutors. This advancement is reshaping student engagement and learning management, fostering an educational environment where technology plays a pivotal role in both instruction and interaction. Chatbots, equipped with natural language processing capabilities, offer students personalized learning experiences by addressing individual queries, providing instant feedback, and facilitating continuous communication beyond traditional classroom settings. These tools not only enhance accessibility to educational resources but also enable educators to focus on more complex pedagogical tasks by automating routine administrative functions. © 2026, IGI Global Scientific Publishing. All rights reserved.
