TI  - Ketamine-Ethanol Combination Decreases Reduced Glutathione Levels and Activates both Intrinsic and Extrinsic Apoptotic Pathways Prior to Neuronal Death in SH-SY5Y Cells
AU  - Castelhano, F.V.D.
AU  - Almeida, C.A.D.F.
AU  - Braz, G.D.A.
AU  - Pereira, G.O.
AU  - Almeida, R.Y.S.D.
