AB  - The rapid evolution of Artificial Intelligence (AI) technologies has begun to transform various educational domains, including the field of English as a Foreign Language (EFL) and English as a Second Language (ESL) instruction. As these technologies continue to develop, their potential to support ongoing teacher development in EFL/ ESL contexts becomes increasingly evident. This chapter explores the multifaceted roles that AI can play in enhancing teacher training, providing personalized professional development opportunities, and fostering reflective teaching practices. The content is grounded in both theoretical perspectives and practical applications, offering insights into how AI can contribute to sustainable and impactful teacher development. © 2025, IGI Global Scientific Publishing. All rights reserved.
