AB  - The goals of this chapter are to review artificial intelligence and big data techniques in precision medicine and corroborate applications of artificial intelligence techniques to solve challenges in immunological disorders. The integration of artificial intelligence in precision medicine has strengthened immunology in biomedical sciences. Precision medicine detects the health outcomes of specific patients. Biomedical studies have shown that clinical research defining the integration of artificial intelligence and precision medicine will present solutions for the challenging issues in precision medicine. This chapter covers various features of artificial intelligence in precision medicine that may nourish biomedical science research. We discuss how artificial intelligence solidifies the technical environment of precision medicine and the application of artificial intelligence methods to analyze biomedical big data of immunological disorders. © 2025, IGI Global Scientific Publishing. All rights reserved.
