AB  - In the context of the growing use of AI in education, this chapter explores the challenges and opportunities of integrating AI with education for sustainable development (ESD) in higher education (HE). It argues that equity, teaching, and assessment practices must be at the heart of this integration to promote social justice and to ensure that the benefits of AI are shared equally. The chapter outlines a vision for AI in ESD that is grounded in equity, pedagogy, and assessment. It explores the potential of AI in supporting the integration of ESD in Higher Education, and the need for innovative and inclusive practices that can help to address it. In the introduction, briefly explain the importance of ESD and the role of AI in supporting it. An overview of the challenges and opportunities associated with using AI in ESD is examined. The role of equity in ESD, and how AI can be used to promote it are discussed. The chapter also highlights the importance of assessment in ESD, and how AI can be used to support it. © 2025 by IGI Global Scientific Publishing. All rights reserved.
