AB  - The chapter investigates the transformative potential of Artificial Intelligence (AI) in promoting mental health well-being and enhancing the healthcare services and educational engagement. Indeed, AI technologies today transform every sector and offer opportunities to reveal new mental health resolutions and various social interaction possibilities. This will be engaged in the following discussion with an overview of how AI-driven tools could enhance personal care and educational engagement. Apart from major advantages, the present chapter also raises important concerns and challenges related to ethical issues and the need for human oversight. The chapter insisted on a strong ethical framework that would help ensure responsible use of AI technologies to improve overall human well-being, making sure that such advancements ensure improvement and quite the reverse in degrading human lives, with access remaining fair to all in all sectors. It is stressed that careful policy and design are required to harness AI's potential responsibly. © 2025 by Nova Science Publishers, Inc. All rights reserved.
