AB  - The integration of Artificial Intelligence（AI） into nursing education represents a profound transforma-tion shift from technological advancement to educational paradigms reconfiguration. Through intelligent tools such as multimodal interaction systems，knowledge graph construction，and virtual simulation platforms，AI is fundamentally reconstructing the nursing education ecosystem. This revolution enhances teaching efficiency while enabling comprehensive upgrades in personalized learning and practical skill development. Grounded in the core concepts of AI，this paper analyzes prevalent AI tools and their specific applications in nursing education contexts. It systematically explores the technical logic of AI empowerment，current challenges，and future trends. By integrating academic rigor with practical applicability，the study aims to proposes a Chinese solution for the digital transformation of nursing education. © 2025 by the Chinese Nursing Association.
