AB  - In the recent years, we have witnessed the rapid development of technology, which has had a significant impact on various sectors of society. The Covid-19 pandemic has highlighted the urgency of finding a fast and efficient approach to implementing and adapting the technological potential provided by Industry 4.0 in the various areas of our lives. In view of this, higher education was also affected to a very large extent by these processes and faced serious challenges caused by the fact that the development of artificial intelligence led to essential changes related to the implementation of the educational process, changing the approaches to teaching and learning. This report aims to analyze the complex dynamics between technological development and the development of higher education, focusing attention on the challenges posed by the process of integrating artificial intelligence into the educational process. In this regard, a conceptual framework of a model is proposed, which presents the main directions that cover the technological/digital transformation of the educational process, as well as of the educational environment as a whole. © 2025 American Institute of Physics Inc.. All rights reserved.
