AB  - The introduction of Chat-GPT in 2022 has sparked discussions within the educational community about its ethical implications. As AI-based applications proliferate, they offer interactive learning avenues in the scholarly community. This research seeks to investigate the impact of AI-enabled personalized learning in higher education and explore collaborative strategies between humans and AI systems to enhance teaching and learning processes. Employing a quantitative approach, the study will analyze data collected from students and educators. The research findings will shed light on the discrepancies between traditional human-led education systems and AI-driven approaches. Additionally, the research will make practical and theoretical contributions to existing literature. The insights gained from this research will assist stakeholders in comprehending and embracing future educational practices that involve AI technologies. © 2025, IGI Global Scientific Publishing. All rights reserved.
