TI  - Adopting AI in education: optimizing human resource management considering teacher perceptions
AU  - Gârdan, I.P.
AU  - Manu, M.B.
AU  - Gârdan, D.A.
AU  - Negoiță, L.D.L.
AU  - Paştiu, C.A.
AU  - Ghiță, E.
AU  - Zaharia, A.
