AB  - This study is a panoramic overview of the role of artificial intelligence and the importance of human judgment in it. This study starts with the introduction of artificial intelligence and the role of human judgment. Further in this study, a public survey was taken regarding the preference of human and artificial intelligence in various sectors such as education, healthcare, agriculture, etc. Later it discussed the results of the survey taken. The study concludes by discussing combining human intelligence with artificial intelligence to get maximum use of artificial intelligence (AI) for the betterment of society. The results reveal that not only artificial intelligence or human intelligence is sufficient, but it is based on specific sectors or areas, and according to the requirement or demand, AI, human intelligence, or a combination of these two should be considered for the maximum, sustainable, and reliable outcomes. © The Author(s), under exclusive license to Springer Nature Switzerland AG 2025.
