AB  - Modern advances in Artificial Intelligence (AI) and Machine Learning (ML) have transformed many businesses and elements of everyday life. Machine learning and deep learning support disease diagnosis, drug development, and patient risk assessment. This study examines how healthcare organizations evaluate enormous data sets using machine learning. This paper examines pros and downsides of current methods and research obstacles. Our goal is to educate healthcare professionals and government organizations on machine learning-based big data analytics in intelligent healthcare. AIML-powered chatbots enable governments educate and serve residents. They assist people get permits, answer questions, and use government services. Assistants help students make appointments, answer inquiries, and offer course material. Lead generation, product recommendations, and marketing efforts using AIML chatbots may boost revenue. AIML helps companies make data-driven decisions, find patterns, and recognize trends using data analysis and predictive analytics. Machine Learning studies how computers learn and improve without programming. Machine learning (ML) is a very captivating technology that has garnered significant interest over the course of technological advancements. As indicated by its nomenclature, this attribute endows the computer with a capacity that enhances its resemblance to human behaviour: the ability to acquire knowledge. © 2025 the Author(s).
