TI  - From Traditional to Intelligent: How Artificial Intelligence (AI) is Shaping Online Education in India
AU  - Bhagat, K.K.
AU  - Rajendran, R.
AU  - Jha, N.K.
AB  - This chapter investigates the transformative role of Artificial Intelligence (AI) in reshaping online education in India. AI significantly enhances educational paradigms by personalising learning experiences, providing instantaneous feedback, and expanding access and efficiency across diverse learning environments. Through adaptive learning technologies and AI-powered content management, education is becoming more tailored and interactive, addressing individual learner’s needs and preferences. Key innovations include intelligent tutoring systems and customised content delivery that adapts to each student’s unique challenges and strengths. The chapter also delves into the ethical dimensions and privacy issues accompanying AI integration in educational settings, underscoring the need for a responsible approach to AI deployment. Ethical AI use in education requires careful consideration of data privacy, algorithmic bias, and the inclusivity of technological solutions. As AI continues to evolve within the educational sector, the chapter calls for a balanced strategy that integrates AI capabilities with fundamental human insights to enhance both teaching effectiveness and learning outcomes, ensuring a synergistic relationship between technology and traditional educational roles. © 2026 selection and editorial matter, National Institute of Educational Planning and Administration (NIEPA); individual chapters, the contributors.
