AB  - In the era where the integration of chatbots as virtual tutors in the field of learning management systems (LMSs) has led to a transformative shift in the sphere of modern education, it has also caused everyone to highlight how the educational needs are perfectly met. This chapter focuses on the multifaceted roles of chatbots as virtual tutors, and explores their benefits, challenges and future potential, taking into account the evolving landscape of education and the connected areas. It shows how chatbot technology is reshaping the way students learn and interact with educational content. Within LMSs, chatbots act as virtual tutors, guiding, supporting and providing answers to the questions posed by learners. They do so by leveraging artificial intelligence (AI) and natural language processing. The chapter considers future trends, including the potential for chatbots to evolve with advancements in AI and their role in shaping the future of digital education. © ISTE Ltd 2025.
