AB  - Artificial Intelligence (AI) is significantly transforming student guidance and support through tools like chatbots and conversational assistants, which provide academic, emotional, and administrative assistance through the use of natural language processing and machine learning. These AI-powered tools enhance students’ educational experiences by ensuring flexible access to assistance, real-time information, and continuous support. Enhancing Student Support and Learning Through Conversational AI focuses on the role of conversational AI in enhancing student guidance, presenting innovative research and practical applications that address the diverse needs of learners. It provides novel research and models for deploying conversational AI and chatbots in education, covering both K-12 and higher education. Covering topics such as curriculum development, leadership education, and virtual counseling, this book is an excellent resource for educators, administrators, policymakers, researchers, academicians, and more. © 2026 by IGI Global Scientific Publishing. All rights reserved.
