AB  - The use of Artificial Intelligence (AI) in English Language Teaching (ELT) is set to transform educators' methodologies in language education and students' involvement in language learning. As AI technologies progress, they provide a diverse range of tools and resources aimed at improving teaching methods and learning results. To enable AI to significantly influence the future of language teaching, it is crucial to provide instructors with the knowledge to comprehend, maneuver, and proficiently incorporate these technologies into their classrooms. This chapter examines the diverse AI tools accessible to English language instructors, emphasizing their potential to provide customized, dynamic, and interactive learning experiences. By comprehending the function of AI, educators may adeptly maneuver through the difficulties of these technologies and leverage their capabilities to enhance the language acquisition process, cultivating a more efficient and stimulating educational atmosphere for learners. © 2026 by IGI Global Scientific Publishing. All rights reserved.
