AB  - Artificial intelligence technologies have pioneered significant transformations in numerous industries and are increasingly being adopted in the field of education. AI offers meaningful contributions to the management of information and teaching processes in education with its capability to learn, make intelligent predictions, solve complex problems, and adapt to different languages. With personalized learning experiences, AI has the potential to play an important role in determining areas of improvement by analyzing student performance, while also making teaching methods more effective for teachers. AI applications such as automatic assessment, language recognition, and content analysis provide convenience in fields such as foreign language teaching. The use of learning analytics to monitor student progress increases the efficiency of education systems and supports academic success by providing customized feedback. The aim of this study is to examine the importance of AI in education with its innovative solutions, potential applications, and strategies to improve education systems. © 2025 by IGI Global Scientific Publishing.
