AB  - This chapter explores the dynamic landscape of artificial intelligence (AI)-powered innovation in Science, Technology, Engineering, and Mathematics (STEM) education, focusing on navigating the entrepreneurial journey within this domain. This general review uses a narrative approach to examine how AI and education (AIEd) technologies are changing and reshaping teaching, learning, and entrepreneurial ventures. We elucidate the foundational role of AI in STEM education. The study further delves into unique propositions such as gamification, interdisciplinary learning, and experiential education, showcasing how these approaches shape the entrepreneurial landscape of STEM education. The study concludes that AI-driven innovation is revolutionising the STEM educational landscape, empowering educators and entrepreneurs while AIEd presents a mammoth of opportunities springing from the intersection of AI and STEM education. Again, AIEd can leverage AI to create solutions and enhance STEM education. The chapter concludes with reflections on the future directions of AI-powered innovation in STEM education. © 2025 selection and editorial matter, Richard Boateng and Sheena Lovia Boateng; individual chapters, the contributors.
