AB  - In order to solve the problem of sharing English teaching resources among different campuses of the same school, an English teaching information management system is proposed under the background of artificial intelligence. The hardware design of the system is realized based on the design of the English teaching resources storage module and the design of the system server; the software design of the system is realized based on the design of the system operating environment and the design of the database. The results show that the proposed comprehensive English teaching resources information management system is more suitable for sharing English teaching resources information than the conventional comprehensive English teaching resources information management system. © 2024 The Authors.
