AB  - While artificial intelligence technology is increasing its development and function day by day, some professionals fear that their jobs will disappear. The fact that artificial intelligence imitates human intelligence and can perform operations beyond human intelligence reveals ideas that artificial intelligence technology will replace humans in business life. This study addresses the transformation and development brought about by artificial intelligence technology, which has marked the 21st century and enabled great developments, within the framework of professions with a descriptive method. Thus, by revealing the professions that have been transformed with artificial intelligence and the direction of this transformation, the impact of artificial intelligence on professions is tried to make sense. The study allows inferences to be made on the positive and negative effects of the transformation of artificial intelligence on professions. © 2024, IGI Global. All rights reserved.
