AB  - This chapter examines the integration of artificial intelligence (AI) in entrepreneurial idea generation, highlighting a shift due to advanced AI. It explores AI's role in augmenting human creativity and transforming entrepreneurial methods. The analysis covers AI algorithms' ability to identify market trends, predict consumer needs, and provide insights, improving the ideation process. Ethical issues, such as data privacy, bias, and effects on human creativity, are discussed. Case studies demonstrate entrepreneurs using AI for innovative ideas and ventures. The chapter concludes by predicting AI's future in entrepreneurship, underlining its influence on business innovation and potential to equalize opportunities in diverse sectors. © 2024, IGI Global. All rights reserved.
