TI  - From trivial answers to critical questions: Transforming education with ai-driven inquiry scenarios
AU  - Damasevicius, R.
AB  - The educational landscape is undergoing a seismic shift, moving away from traditional paradigms that prioritize rote learning and static answers. This chapter introduces a novel educational approach that leverages AI-driven inquiry scenarios and prompt engineering, emphasizing the development of critical questioning skills over the mere provision of answers. This approach aligns with the demands of a rapidly evolving knowledge landscape, often referred to as the "knowledge multiverse. " This approach integrates generative AI, like ChatGPT, as a tool for fostering inquiry-based learning. The methodology focuses on teaching students how to formulate and refine critical questions, a skill the authors term "prompt engineering. " This method involves interactive sessions, workshops, and project-based learning modules where students learn to interact with AI effectively, guiding their learning journey through skillful questioning. This chapter posits that the future of education lies in empowering students to navigate the knowledge multiverse through critical questioning and effective use of AI © 2024, IGI Global. All rights reserved.
