AB  - Artificial intelligence (AI) has become an influential force in the rapidly changing 21st century, drastically changing the educational environment and providing novel approaches to transform teaching, learning, and the future of knowledge. Given the rising popularity of AI technology among educators and students, it is essential to investigate the current environment to comprehend how AI is being used in educational assessment - which is the aim of this book chapter. The study focuses on a few of the latest developments in artificial intelligence (AI)-based learning assessments through a narrative review of past research. Another aim of this chapter is to investigate the challenges related to the seamless incorporation of AI into assessment systems. These challenges allow educators to assess their readiness to incorporate AI tools into their assessment procedure. With its two-fold objective, this book chapter adds to the emerging discussion over how artificial intelligence (AI) could affect the assessment scenario in higher education. © 2024, IGI Global. All rights reserved.
