AB  - Artificial intelligence has emerged as a transformative force across numerous sectors, and its impact on education is no exception. In recent years, AI has gained prominence in the field of education; revolutionizing the way we teach, learn, and administer educational processes. From personalized learning experiences to intelligent tutoring systems, AI has the potential to reshape the future of education, making it more accessible, adaptive, and effective than ever before. The future of learning and teaching will be shaped by the convergence of innovative technologies, data-driven methodologies, and personalized learning experiences. Therefore, the authors explore the dynamic landscape of artificial intelligence in education; this book chapter discusses mainly: AIED areas, AIED applications, learning about AI as well as preparing for AI. © 2024, IGI Global. All rights reserved.
