AU  - Gupta, V.P.
AB  - The rapid advancement of Industry 5.0 demands a skilled workforce, but many students lack the necessary competencies. This chapter explores the transformative potential of AI-driven skill development, aligning education with Industry 5.0 needs. AI analyzes data to personalize skill development. The study aims to bridge the skills gap, emphasizing positive outcomes like enhanced workforce preparedness. AI's potential offers a promising solution for the evolving job market. Investing in AI-driven skill development is imperative for a skilled and adaptable workforce in Industry 5.0. © 2024, IGI Global. All rights reserved.
