AB  - With the continuous progress of educational technology, gamification has become an effective means to enhance learning efficiency and motivation. This paper explores the application of emotion recognition technology in the design of gamified courses, aiming to optimize the learning experience by real-time monitoring and analysis of learners' emotional responses. The paper first reviews the theoretical foundations of gamified learning, as well as the development of emotion recognition technology, particularly facial expression recognition and analysis techniques. Subsequently, the paper introduces a still experimental emotion model. The objective of this research is to integrate emotion recognition technology into gamified learning to improve learner engagement and learning outcomes. This paper provides new perspectives and methods for the field of educational technology, contributing to the development of more humanized and efficient learning environments. © 2024 IEEE.
