AB  - One of the most important technologies of the 21st century is artificial intelligence (AI). The significant increase in computing power, the availability of data, and the progress made in algorithms (Samoili, et al., 2020) have allowed artificial intelligence to play an increasing role in higher education (HE). In response to the increasing role of AI in HE, this book was composed to inform members of the HE community what is known about this topic. A variety of AI tools are described, including the more recent Generative AI (GenAI) tools, such as ChatGPT, which have increased interest in artificial intelligence exponentially (Fuchs, 2023). © 2025 selection and editorial matter, Helen Crompton and Diane Burke; individual chapters, the contributors.
