AB  - Artificial Intelligence (AI) is a transformational technology that has the potential to completely change everything in various fields. In education, AI has been focused on due to its ability towards customization as well as adaptability in learning. Some of these technologies including 'OATutor' and 'Intelligent Tutoring Supported Collaborative Learning (ITSCL), have made their mark in the education industry. However, they often encounter hurdles like deep concept understanding, fostering creativity, encouraging critical thinking and promoting effective problem-solving skills. This abstract outlines the 'AI Tutor', a unique educational solution that fully overcomes these challenges. The 'AI Tutor' exploits GPT-4's language understanding and Invideo AI's text-to-video generation capabilities to deliver customized educational videos, lectures and quizzes. Moreover, it tailors itself to individual needs of learners ensuring that content delivery remains dynamic and engaging while assessments are carried out so effectively with progress tracking being done through interactive lessons, videos, quizzes and practice exercises thereby enabling students receive instant feedback and performance analysis about their educational activities. One major strength of 'AI Tutor' is its personalization capability. It is adaptable to the level of each learner, in that it helps them understand information better and acquire more knowledge. The AI Tutor differs from other technologies in that its scope goes beyond superficial levels of learning with objectives of promoting a profound concept comprehension. It also encourages creativity by employing text-to-video generation thus allowing learners to visualize and express their views. In addition, it has been designed to foster critical thinking and problem-solving abilities among learners through presenting them with difficult questions and giving specific feedback so as to develop their analytical skills. © 2024 IEEE.
