AB  - For business, seeking to create more effective marketing campaign the connection between digital marketing and artificial intelligence (AI), is becoming more and more crucial. With the use of artificial intelligence (AI), businesses can improve customer satisfaction and optimize their marketing campaigns by analyzing vast volumes of data, making personalized recommendations, and automating tedious tasks. In light of this, this study investigates how artificial intelligence might enhance digital marketing, particularly through the application of personalization and predic-tive analytics. As a result, this study focuses on a few of the difficulties and factors that businesses need to think about when implementing AI in their marketing campaigns, by an analysis of pertinent literature. Overall, the study concludes that, particularly in light of the recent COVID-19 epidemic and its significant lessons for the corporate world, there is a lot of promise in the interaction between artificial intelligence (AI) and digital marketing for organizations looking to stay ahead of the curve in the current digital era. © The Author(s).
