AB  - Companies looking to develop more successful marketing strategies, the relationship be-tween artificial intelligence (AI) and digital marketing is becoming increasingly important. AI enables organizations to optimize their marketing campaigns and enhance the consumer experience by analyzing massive amounts of data, providing personalized recommendations, and automating repetitive processes. Accordingly, this paper explores the ways in which artificial intelligence can benefit digital marketing, including through the use of predictive analytics and personalization. Accordingly, this study focuses on some of the challenges and considerations that companies must take into account when incorporating artificial intelligence into their marketing efforts. By reviewing the relevant literature. Overall, the paper concludes that the relationship between AI and digital marketing has great potential for companies seeking to stay ahead of the curve in today's digital age especially after the Corona pandemic, which provided an important lesson for the business environment. © The Author(s), under exclusive license to Springer Nature Switzerland AG 2024.
