AB  - The chapter aims to conceptualize and study policies pertaining to artificial intelligence (AI), digital economy (DE), and education in India. AI is growing technological advancement and is applicable to all the domains of economic, political, and social life. AI is an innovative technology capable of integrating and transforming the DE. Already, developed countries have progressed in the area by the application of AI. As an emerging economy in Asia, India has a promising future and it aspires to become the largest economy of the world. However, the challenges of the future will emerge out of the association between AI and DE. Education policies can create a workforce suited for the DE. With Industrialization 4.0 at the door, it is high time for India to gear up. © 2024 by Apple Academic Press, Inc.
