TI  - Design of Structure using an Adaptive Generative AI System for Customised Eduction for Individuals
AU  - Sharma, S.
AU  - Raj, M.
AU  - Ali, M.M.
AU  - Sharma, K.
AU  - Singh, A.
AU  - Singh, S.
AB  - In today's tech world, we observe artificial intelligence (AI) reshaping the landscape of learning. Our research introduces the Generative AI-Powered Learning Platform. This platform enables learners to leverage AI for a more comprehensive learning experience. It's user-friendly - simply input 2-4 keywords and a brief topic description, and it generates learning materials for you. These materials provide clear summaries, practical examples, in-depth explanations, and questions tailored to diverse learning needs. What sets our platform apart is its ability not only to generate content but also to allow users to share external materials for a more thorough exploration, connecting AI-generated knowledge with external insights. However, it's not solely about content. We've incorporated something innovative. real-time sentiment analysis using your webcam. The system discerns your emotional state and adjusts the learning material on-the-fly. If confusion is detected, it adapts to enhance clarity and engagement. The amalgamation of AI-generated content and emotionally responsive learning introduces a novel approach that is personalized and highly effective.Our research delves into the Generative AI-Powered Learning Platform, elucidating its functioning, capabilities, and its tangible benefits for learning. It provides a glimpse into the future of education with AI - a paradigm shift in how we learn, in a genuinely human and effective manner. © 2024 IEEE.
