AU  - Zoelfakar, S.
AU  - Sebastian, S.
AB  - This chapter explores the integration of micro-credentials within vocational and professional training, emphasising the transformative potential when combined with artificial intelligence (AI). Micro-credentials offer flexible, skill-specific certifications that align closely with the evolving demands of the workforce, providing rapid upskilling and targeted competency development. By leveraging AI, these credentials can be enhanced through personalised learning pathways, efficient assessment methods, and secure validation processes. This synergistic approach not only supports lifelong learning and continuous professional development but also addresses the dynamic needs of the 21st-century job market, fostering a more adaptive and skilled workforce. © 2025 by IGI Global Scientific Publishing. All rights reserved.
