TI  - Overview of Applications of Artificial Intelligence (AI) in Diverse Fields
AU  - Kuhar, N.
AU  - Kumria, P.
AU  - Rani, S.
AB  - Artificial Intelligence is the ability of a system or a program to think and learn from experience. AI applications have significantly evolved over the past few years and have found their applications in almost every business sector. From chat-bots handling customer service inquiries to predictive analytics optimizing supply chain management, AI is transforming how businesses operate. In the current chapter, applications of AI in various fields have been discussed such as science, education, healthcare, defense, e-commerce, finance, etc. Importance and utilization of AI in wastewater treatment have been discussed at the end of the chapter. In the field of wastewater treatment, AI technology has proven to be a game-changer. By harnessing the power of artificial intelligence, various stages of wastewater treatment can be optimized in real-time. AI algorithms can continuously monitor and adjust param-eters such as chemical dosages, aeration rates, and sludge management to ensure maximum efficiency and effectiveness in the treatment process. The integration of AI in wastewater treatment not only enhances the overall performance but also paves the way for sustainable and innovative solutions in managing our water resources effectively. © The Editor(s) (if applicable) and The Author(s), under exclusive license to Springer Nature Switzerland AG 2024.
