TI  - A Detailed Investigation on Digital Technology and AI in Social Sectors
AU  - Lincy Simon Shepherd, B.T.
AU  - Jacob, A.A.
AB  - Digital technology has become an essential aspect of our daily lives and has a significant impact in various sectors. These technologies play a crucial role in addressing difficult challenges and improving processes, ultimately shaping the future development of human society. It is crucial to examine the significant influence of digital technology and AI in various areas, as their combination continues to grow and redefine societal norms, organizational structures, and the essence of human civilization. AI systems are designed to be conscious of their surroundings and make decisions that optimize their chances of achieving specific goals. The integration of AI into digital technology is predicted to result in substantial societal transformations as society shifts towards a more digital era. In our study we investigate the future of digital technology and artificial intelligence in various sectors and about how these different industries are adapting the advanced AI tools and technologies to stay competitive and relevant. © 2025 by IGI Global Scientific Publishing. All rights reserved.
