AB  - This book chapter explores the potential of AI in modernizing public administration and services with a specific focus on the Philippines. It examines how AI technologies improve administrative efficiency, streamline public services, and enhance decision- making in key areas such as administrative efficiency, law enforcement, disaster management, education, data privacy, cybersecurity, information dissemination, social services, and legal practice. The chapter highlights global trends and innovations in AI applications and considers their implications for the Philippine government. It also addresses the challenges of AI adoption including algorithmic bias, privacy concerns, and technical constraints. Drawing on case studies and examples from various countries, the chapter provides recommendations for strategic AI implementation in the Philippines which stressed the need for capacity- building, policy frameworks, and ethical considerations to ensure the responsible use of AI in public service. © 2025 by IGI Global Scientific Publishing. All rights reserved.
