AB  - Artificial intelligence integration in education is proven to be an easier and convenient way of delivering knowledge to students and hence became the demand of 21st-century classrooms. The findings from the literature review show that implementing artificial intelligence in education by following different pedagogical models of artificial intelligence in education (i.e. the SAMR model, the TPACK model, and the TAM model) can lead to fruitful outcomes in the teaching and learning process, and also this study would help in fulfilling the knowledgeable, contextual, and pedagogical gaps for the integration of artificial intelligence in the era of digitization of education. © 2023, IGI Global. All rights reserved.
