TI  - Integration of IoT-Enabled Technologies and Artificial Intelligence (AI) for Smart City Scenario: Recent Advancements and Future Trends
AU  - Alahi, M.E.E.
AU  - Sukkuea, A.
AU  - Tina, F.W.
