AB  - In recent years, there has been a constant effort to integrate artificial intelligence (AI) and other advancement into educational setting to enhance learning experience. This paper presents a comprehensive review of the substantial impact of ChatGPT, AI language model for conversations, on the modern education landscape. As the educational paradigm continues to evolve in the digital age, Artificial Intelligence is playing an increasingly pivotal role, with ChatGPT at the forefront of this transformative shift. Through a detailed analysis of a diverse range of educational applications, this study delves into the multifaceted role that ChatGPT assumes in redefining traditional teaching methodologies. Its versatility is exemplified across scenarios, comprising personalized tutoring, text generation, language acquisition, and even assistance in creative writing. ChatGPT offers exceptional capabilities to enhance student engagement and meet a variety of learning demands by enabling quick responses and engaging in logical conversations. Moreover, this review critically examines the ethical considerations and challenges that emerge when deploying ChatGPT in educational contexts. Striking a balance between the advantages of AI-driven support and concerns related to potential biases, data privacy and authenticity underscores the complex landscape that educators, students and researchers must navigate. © 2023 IEEE.
