AB  - This research was inspired by the trending Ai Chatbot technology, a popular theme that contributed massively to technology breakthroughs in the 21st century. Beginning in 2023, AI Chatbot has been a popular trend that is continuously growing. The demand for such application servers has soared high in 2023. It has caused many concerns about using such technologies in a learning environment, such as a personalized adaptive learning system. Implementing the AI Chatbot, however, could revolutionize how people learn. However, issues also emerge on how we, as users, can avoid misleading information caused by AI hallucinations and how to resolve it. The method used in this research is a systematic literature review and proposal of an AI-based adaptive learning system that can be implemented by using AI as a media in between the system. The result of this research is a proposal for an AI-based Learning System and ways to prevent issues regarding AI learning from occurring in a learning system. © 2023 IEEE.
