AB  - Artificial intelligence is the most important recent innovation in digital technology. The availability of chatbots such as ChatGPT will create profound changes in both teaching and learning. The OpenAI technologies, once some of the errors of their infancy are going be fixed, will quickly spread worldwide, and their use will impact many aspects of our society. The potentialities and advantages will overcome the fears, and both teachers and students will have to learn to make the best out of it. The benefits of artificial intelligence for physics education are illustrated in this document with a few examples. It is important in our view that government regulations and sponsorships prevent further inequalities and long-term fixations of disparities, keeping the cost of available AI programs low. © The Author(s), under exclusive license to Springer Nature Switzerland AG 2023.
