AB  - Intelligent teaching style evaluation has grown in popularity. The video is one of the most accessible resources for evaluation. Yet, there is currently no comprehensive, highly accurate method for processing teaching videos. Thankfully, there are numerous top-notch deep learning-based video categorization methods available as references. A hybrid CNN-LSTM model that is effective at modeling time-series teaching style information is what we propose, drawing on the benefits of video classification research. Our efforts' effectiveness is demonstrated through experiments on a dataset we created for in-class teaching. © 2023 IEEE.
