TI  - Development of a Classification Model for Predicting Student Payment Behavior Using Artificial Intelligence and Data Science Techniques
AU  - Villarreal-Torres, H.
AU  - Ángeles-Morales, J.
AU  - Cano-Mejía, J.
AU  - Mejía-Murillo, C.
