AB  - This research study presents a comprehensive overview of the opportunities and challenges posed by Artificial Intelligence (AI). This research study begins with an introduction to the different types of AI and then discusses about the applications of AI in various fields. This study also explores the challenges associated with developing and implementing AI models, such as ethical considerations, privacy concerns, and the potential impact on employment. Finally, this study concludes with a discussion on the future of AI, including the development of explainable AI and the potential for AI to address some of the most urgent issues face by the world currently, including healthcare and climate change. Overall, this research study provides a comprehensive overview of the current state of AI, its potential impact, and the challenges that must be addressed to ensure its responsible and beneficial integration into society. © 2023 IEEE.
