AB  - Today, Artificial Intelligence is already part of our environment and is used in various social, economic, and educational fields. Therefore, incorporating Artificial Intelligence technology in any field is an emerging need because it generates new opportunities to offer better products and services. However, to stay ahead, it is necessary to implement the right technology to change the competitive landscape in organizations and educational institutions. This work proposes the incorporation of ChatBots as a new proposal to perform virtual academic advisories within the Institutional Tutoring Program of the Universidad Autonoma de Sinaloa to strengthen the Peer Advisors program. In this sense, an instrument in Google form has been designed and validated to know the student’s and professors’ opinions of the Faculty of Computer Science before its development. © 2023, The Author(s), under exclusive license to Springer Nature Switzerland AG.
