AB  - Online education system has become inevitable in the digital era. The COVID-19 pandemic forced transformation in almost all the sectors including education. The online education which is prevailing for more than few decades suddenly spiked up for widespread adoption in the educational institutions. Despite several advantages, there are some drawbacks which are monitoring student’s attentiveness, assessment of effectiveness, personal interaction, etc. The recent developments and easy integration of artificial intelligence (AI) can be leveraged in the online education system for effective and better results which fulfil these gaps. In the proposed system, the AI services are used to add more intelligence into the system using the image and video analysis, speech-to-text and other services to eliminate the drawbacks which is prevailing in the present online education system. It is pertinent to mention that every system needs to be defined for better understanding. Considering this, the architecture of online education system has been outlined in this paper. The proposed AI-powered architecture consists more features in the form of agents which are discussed in detail. © 2023, The Author(s), under exclusive license to Springer Nature Singapore Pte Ltd.
