AB  - In the world, the technological and industrial revolution is accelerating by the widespread application of new generation information and communication technologies, such as AI, IoT (the Internet of Things), and blockchain technology. Artificial intelligence has attracted much attention from government, industry, and academia. In this study, popular articles published in recent years that relate to artificial intelligence are selected and explored. This study aims to provide a review of artificial intelligence based on industry information integration. It presents an overview of the scope of artificial intelligence using background, drivers, technologies, and applications, as well as logical opinions regarding the development of artificial intelligence. This paper may play a role in AI-related research and should provide important insights for practitioners in the real world.The main contribution of this study is that it clarifies the state of the art of AI for future study. © 2021 Elsevier Inc.
