AB  - In the era of big data, artificial intelligence (AI) has been widely applied in higher education, providing technical supports to practical teaching in colleges and universities. This paper mainly creates an AI-based practical teaching mode for cultural industry management major of Chongqing Three Gorges University. Firstly, an intelligent management cloud platform was established for practical teaching, drawing the merits from Massive Open Online Course (MOOC) and Self-Paced Open Course (SPOC). Meanwhile, the AI technique was adopted to realize personalized learning and provide intelligent push services. In this way, the online MOOC+SPOC platform seamlessly integrates the teaching content into specific teaching scenarios, and the offline cloud platform manages the teaching process in an intelligent manner. Under the proposed teaching mode, the teaching content could match the job competence standards and the actual abilities of college students. The research results provide a new mode of practical teaching that covers all dimensions and promotes personalized and collaborative learning. © 2020 Kassel University Press GmbH.
