TI  - Leveraging Artificial Intelligence for Teacher Licensing: Innovations in Assessment and Professional Development
AU  - Ismail, M.A.
AB  - Artificial intelligence is recognized as a pivotal technological catalyst driving innovations in educational settings. This systematic study reviews how AI technologies are integrated and explores their impact on reshaping the roles of teachers and their professional development needs. The rapid advancement of AI is providing unprecedented opportunities in education, fostering innovative and creative teaching and learning methods. By implementing AI technologies, not only do teachers enhance the learning experience, but they also improve teaching efficiency, allowing them more time to innovate and enhance instructional methods. Thus, with the present research it is clear that integrating AI not only enriches the effectiveness of learning but also can lead to advancements. © 2026 by IGI Global Scientific Publishing. All rights reserved.
