AB  - Introduction: In the era of the fourth industrial revolution, Artificial Intelligence (AI) stands at the forefront of technological innovation, transforming various sectors including sports. This paper delves into the innovative applications of AI in sports, examining its impact on school, family, and community sports. It explores how AI can enhance physical activity quality and user experience, offering a vision for the future of sports education and training. Methods: In this paper, we have used literature method, interview and survey method, logical analysis method Conclusions: AI technology is expected to further optimise physical activity, provide more accurate assessment and feedback systems, and will be more widely used in the future of home, school and social sport In addition AI technology has the potential to address the unequal distribution of teachers. Overall, AI technology will profoundly change the face of sport, making it more efficient, fun and inclusive. © 2024 Copyright held by the owner/author(s).
