TI  - AI-Powered University Admission Counseling: A Use Case of Large Language Models in Student Guidance
AU  - Nang Hung Van, N.N.H.
AU  - Do, P.H.
AU  - Hoang, V.N.
AU  - Nguyen, T.T.K.
AU  - Pham, M.T.
