AB  - With the continuous development of technology, electromagnetic compatibility issues have become increasingly important in fields such as electronics and communication. This paper provides a preliminary exploration of the electromagnetic compatibility principle course based on artificial intelligence. Firstly, the objectives and requirements, content system, and problems of traditional teaching methods of the Electromagnetic Compatibility Principles course were outlined. Then, the current application status of artificial intelligence in the field of education was analyzed, including teaching assistance and management, personalized learning experience, and intelligent decision support. On this basis, the course design plan was elaborated in detail from the aspects of course teaching mode design, teaching content optimization, and application of intelligent teaching tools. Finally, a summary and outlook were made on the course of electromagnetic compatibility principles based on artificial intelligence, with the aim of providing new ways and methods for cultivating high-quality electromagnetic compatibility professionals who can meet the needs of the times. © 2024 IEEE.
