TI  - How generative AI models such as ChatGPT can be (mis)used in SPC practice, education, and research? An exploratory study
AU  - Megahed, F.M.
AU  - Chen, Y.-J.
AU  - Ferris, J.A.
AU  - Knoth, S.
AU  - Jones-Farmer, L.A.
