TI  - Detecting GenAI assistance in programming assessments with over-uniqueness and sample matching
AU  - Karnalim, O.
AU  - Toba, H.
AU  - Wijanto, M.C.
AU  - Setiawan, Y.D.
AU  - Surantha, N.
AU  - Liut, M.
