AB  - Generative AI is revolutionizing business education by making lesson planning easier, providing additional personalized instruction, and automating administrative tasks. ChatGPT, DALL-E, and Gradescope are tools that simplify the generation of content, adaptive learning, and grading issues, but with concerns over data privacy and bias. This makes the emergence of trends like AI-based virtual classrooms and gamification, the ones that can provide an immersive and future-ready learning experience. This chapter identifies how AI develops the power of educators, fuels engagement by students, and reorganizes the area of learning business, while controlling innovation and ethical obligations. © 2026, IGI Global Scientific Publishing. All rights reserved.
