TI  - Generative AI is changing personalized learning to help us build a sustainable future
AU  - Kowar, S.
AU  - Mukhopadhayay, N.D.
AB  - Generative artificial intelligence (GAI) is the process of analyzing a variety of inputs to produce new content, such as books, music, or artwork. GAI has the ability to create new opportunities in the creative industry. GAI might analyze data from different historical eras and civilizations to discover unique aesthetic combinations. Its well-reasoned arguments may even be able to forecast the number of distinct creative genres that will mix and have an influence on society before any art is created. GAI's storytelling skills about literary works that strike a balance are improving. Students may soon be able to practice reading novels produced by artificial intelligence (AI) thanks to individualized learning algorithms. The stories would be tailored to each learner's interests and understanding level, and the AI would improve its storytelling skills by analyzing feedback. Personalized learning based on GAI will demonstrate how it fosters creativity. © 2025 by IGI Global Scientific Publishing. All rights reserved.
