TI  - Revolutionizing scientific research: The role of AI and the metaverse in modern discovery
AU  - Asrifan, A.
AU  - Ingilan, S.S.
AB  - This chapter analyzes the transformative impact of artificial intelligence (AI) and the metaverse on contemporary scientific study. It emphasizes how AI improves data analysis, allowing researchers to quickly examine extensive datasets and extract previously challenging insights. AI in the metaverse promotes collaborative settings, enabling academics to participate in real- time exchanges and interdisciplinary initiatives. This collaboration enhances research methods and fosters innovation and originality in scientific exploration. The chapter examines the ethical ramifications of modern technologies, underscoring the necessity for responsible data management methods and study integrity. As AI and the metaverse advance, they are poised to transform scientific study, presenting novel opportunities and difficulties for scholars. Adopting these developments will be essential for tackling intricate worldwide challenges and furthering understanding in diverse scientific domains. © 2025, IGI Global Scientific Publishing. All rights reserved.
