AB  - Artificial Intelligence (AI) is transforming sectors like healthcare, education, fi-nance, and security by enhancing efficiency, personalization, and decision-making. In healthcare, Al supports diagnostics, predictive care, and resource optimization, though privacy and bias remain concerns. Education benefits from adaptive learning and automation but faces challenges in equity and data ethics. Finance leverages Al for fraud detection, trading, and risk analysis, yet regulatory oversight is vital to prevent discrimination and instability. In security, Al enhances surveillance and cyber defense but raises ethical issues around privacy and autonomy. Generative Al fuels creativity but risks misinformation and copyright breaches. Ensuring fairness, transparency, and ethical governance is crucial for sustainable, inclusive Al adoption. © 2026 by IGI Global Scientific Publishing. All rights reserved.
