AB  - Artificial intelligence (AI) and generative artificial intelligence (GI) are revolutionizing contemporary game development through the facilitation of adaptive gameplay, procedural content production, and intricate narrative structures. AI-driven solutions provide real-time responses to player inputs, hence fostering dynamic and evolving gaming experiences, in contrast to traditional game design, which relies on pre-scripted procedures and static environments. These technologies equip developers with innovative tools to create immersive, tailored, and intelligent gaming environments, ultimately revolutionizing the processes of game development, gameplay, and user experience. Procedural content generation, which enables developers to produce extensive, dynamic environments with no human involvement, is one of the most potent applications of artificial intelligence in gaming. © 2026 by IGI Global Scientific Publishing. All rights reserved.
