AU  - Pereira Sousa, J.P.
AU  - Correia Tavares, R.J.
AB  - AI and GenAI are revolutionizing the video game industry. From procedurally generated worlds and non-playable characters to personalized gameplay experiences, these technologies are transforming how games are developed and experienced. Game studios are increasingly using AI and GenAI to streamline content creation and enhance realism, ultimately pushing the boundaries of what games can achieve. This reshaping of the video game landscape not only redefines entertainment but also opens new possibilities for education, social interaction, and digital economies within virtual environments. Reshaping the Video Game Landscape With AI and GenAI explores how AI and GenAI have affected the video gaming world. This book demonstrates how AI and GenAI can improve development workflows, create new player experiences, and support inclusive and ethical design. Covering topics such as AI, gaming, and development, this book is an excellent resource for researchers, academicians, game designers, and industry professionals. © 2026 by IGI Global Scientific Publishing. All rights reserved.
