AB  - The convergence of advanced technologies, data analytics, and human-centered design principles reshapes the healthcare landscape. Industry 5.0 represents a paradigm shift from automation to collaboration. This translates to a harmonious coexistence of advanced technologies, healthcare professionals, and patients in healthcare. The emphasis is on leveraging technology to empower healthcare providers and engage patients actively in their care, fostering a collaborative ecosystem that transcends the traditional boundaries of the industry. Design thinking, an iterative process that empathizes with end-users, becomes a crucial aspect of developing solutions that are not only technologically advanced but also user-friendly and ethical. This chapter explores the pivotal role of Industry 5.0 in fostering a collaborative ecosystem where humans, technology, and data harmoniously interact to enhance healthcare delivery. © 2026 selection and editorial matter, Deergha Sharma, Manisha Gupta, Raj K. Kovid, Thipendra P. Singh, Pradeep Kumar and Ahatsham Hayat; individual chapters, the contributors.
