TI  - Innovations Focusing on Artificial Intelligence in Computer Science Education
AU  - Erdaği, E.
AB  - Computer science education is a field that needs constant development due to technological developments. Especially in recent years, the widespread use of the concept of artificial intelligence in all scientific fields has affected the field of computer science education. Today, the concept of artificial intelligence is used on a very large scale in many fields other than technical fields. This has enabled the integration of the artificial intelligence universe with all fields with an interdisciplinary approach. Artificial intelligence is capable of directing the entire educational process rather than being a stand-alone educational content during computer science education. Students can use this field to solve all problems in their field of expertise during and after their education. In this section, artificial intelligence techniques and subfields used in computer science education, artificial intelligence trends, challenges related to artificial intelligence, and the interaction of the curriculum with artificial intelligence are discussed. © 2025 by IGI Global Scientific Publishing.
