AB  - The healthcare industry is undergoing a significant transformation driven by digital innovation. Among the various technologies propelling this change, AR (Augmented Reality) and VR (Virtual Reality) stand out due to their immersive and interactive capabilities. These technologies offer unprecedented opportunities to enhance medical training, improve patient care, and streamline healthcare operations. The primary objective of this research is to explore the impact of AR and VR in the smart healthcare landscape. The goal is to understand how these technologies are being used globally and to assess their potential for future healthcare delivery. The advent of digital technologies has inspired a paradigm shift in the healthcare sector, fostering the emergence of smart healthcare systems. This chapter highlights the digital transformation of healthcare with a particular focus on the integration of Augmented Reality (AR) and Virtual Reality (VR) technologies are redefining healthcare delivery, training and patient interaction on a global scale. © 2025 by IGI Global Scientific Publishing. All rights reserved.
