AB  - In the ever-evolving landscape of education, the rise of artificial intelligence (AI) and the advent of OpenAI models have ushered in transformative possibilities. This chapter serves as an in-depth exploration, illuminating the core principles of AI and the inner workings of OpenAI models. It unveils the dynamic applications of AI within educational contexts, from personalized learning to administrative streamlining. The chapter commences by unraveling the foundational principles of AI, including machine learning and deep learning, demystifying these technologies that hold immense potential for education. It subsequently delves into the functioning of OpenAI models, shedding light on their architecture, natural language processing capabilities, and their practical utility in the educational domain. This chapter, thus, equips educators, policymakers, researchers, and the broader educational community with the essential knowledge to harness the extraordinary potential of AI for the betterment of learners. © 2024, IGI Global. All rights reserved.
