AB  - This paper outlines a strategic roadmap for catalyzing innovation in the pharmaceutical sector, aligning with the guidelines set forth in the National Education Policy (NEP) of 2020. Focused on incubation and startups, the proposed framework envisions a transformative journey from research laboratories to market-ready solutions. Emphasizing the integration of NEP-2020 principles, this roadmap aims to streamline the synergy between academia and industry, fostering a conducive environment for entrepreneurial ventures. Through this approach, the pharmaceutical landscape is poised to witness accelerated growth, with an emphasis on novel drug development, technology-driven solutions, and sustainable healthcare practices. This abstract advocates for a proactive engagement of pharmacy institutions in shaping the future of pharmaceutical innovation, ushering in a new era of dynamic and impactful contributions to healthcare. © 2024, Indian Pharmaceutical Association. All rights reserved.
