TI  - Enhancing Students’ Research Skills Through AI Tools and Teacher Competencies: A Mixed-Methods Study
AU  - Behnamnia, N.
AU  - Hayati, S.
AU  - Kamsin, A.
AU  - Ahmadi, A.
AU  - Alizadeh, Z.
