AB  - This empirical study examines the manner in which artificial intelligence (AI) is transforming several sectors and the way it might help realize the full potential of people. The study employs an extensive technique that combines a quantitative approach with a detailed examination of the literature. The evolution of artificial intelligence, machine learning, as well as deep learning is followed from historical viewpoints to current developments. This investigation explores how artificial intelligence (AI) is transforming higher education, banking, healthcare, the arts, in addition to manufacturing. It presents quantitative results that demonstrate increased efficiency and better results. The study highlights the necessity of preventative actions, such as reskilling programs, while addressing the difficulties associated with job displacement and ethical issues. The study also explores how AI has developed in order to enhance inventiveness and decision-making, highlighting its beneficial effects on businesses that are undergoing radical change. Understanding AI developments including their revolutionary effects on businesses, as well as clarifying the ways in which AI enhances human potential, are just some of the goals. In general, the study advances a sophisticated comprehension of artificial intelligence's complex influence on the way business and human pursuits will develop in the future. © 2024 IEEE.
