AB  - This chapter introduces the Ada-Rob Skill Communication Design Approach, an innovative framework leveraging generative AI to address communication challenges in service-learning environments. As traditional pedagogies struggle to engage effectively with the social, professional, and civic complexities of real-world applications, the Ada-Rob approach enhances communication through two key components: ‘Ada,' which supports adaptive and personalized learning, and ‘Rob,' which emphasizes role-based, structured interactions. In this framework, “skill communication” refers to expertise-specific interactions enabled by structured collaboration, while “communication skill” encompasses general communicative abilities. The Ada-Rob approach provides a flexible, scalable solution that uses generative AI to foster dynamic and collaborative learning experiences, balancing structured communication with individualized learning pathways. © 2025 by IGI Global Scientific Publishing. All rights reserved.
