AB  - Smart healthcare is shaping global health through a complete revolution by integrating emerging technologies like Augmented Reality (AR) and Virtual Reality (VR). In healthcare, AR and VR enable a deeper connection to medical training, diagnostics and patient care utilizing immersive, interactive environments. These are changing the way medical practitioners perform operations, making complex procedures in a safe environment and handling 3D patient data translating better- performing precision. Patients can receive immersive therapies through AR/VR such as- pain management, mental stimulus- based health treatments etc. and hence benefit from personalized gamified healthcare experiences. Beyond this, these technologies are integral to remote healthcare delivery including telemedicine and virtual consultations that not only transcend geographical barriers but also make quality care more accessible. This chapter comprehensively explores AR and VR in examination of digital transformation in smart healthcare. © 2025 by IGI Global Scientific Publishing. All rights reserved.
